<title>POLAND: Rafako group net turns to profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>Rafako group net turns to profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rafako group results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    18.27   vs   40.13 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 6.76   vs   45.72 loss</p>
<p>    net profit			     7.03   vs   50.89 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Fabryka Kotlow SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    427.71   vs  449.98</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     364.46   vs  373.40</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01   vs    0.04 profit</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.91   vs    3.96</p>
<p>    other taxes				na   vs	na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   8.74   vs   10.42</p>
<p>    financial costs		     25.07   vs   20.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
